mw2coop patch for maps/_blizzard.gsc (Cliffhanger, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. In co-op the blizzard effect is played on each player's "tag_origin", which campaign
   players do not have (no body model): the call fails and the blizzard thread dies on both
   machines. Play it on a tag_origin model that follows the player instead.
@@@ replace
blizzard_start_proc()
{
	while ( 1 )
	{
		if ( is_coop() )
			PlayFXOnTagForClients( level._effect[ "blizzard_main" ], self, "tag_origin", self );
@@@ with
blizzard_start_proc()
{
	fx_ent = self;
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		fx_ent = self maps\_mw2coop::player_tag_ent();
	while ( 1 )
	{
		if ( is_coop() )
			PlayFXOnTagForClients( level._effect[ "blizzard_main" ], fx_ent, "tag_origin", self );
@@@ end
